# Generation 2 controller, unit 09000E000C4330364E353020, firmware 92e3f91ed237696ce9072369b3aed4f93f08cd76
# Captured 2026-08-12 with:  scopelink-cli --port /dev/ttyACM1 --verbose faults
#
# The other half of the pair. This generation has a 56 byte status frame and a 34 byte freeze frame, and
# it is not asked whether a temperature sensor is fitted at all - identifier 0x0302 only exists from
# generation 3 - so the open sequence here is one transaction shorter than the generation 3 one.
#
# This unit's infrared sensor is dead, which is worth having recorded: the ambient and mirror readings are
# the 0xFFFF a failed sensor reports, the fault store holds the timeout, and the I2C error counter has
# saturated at 0xFFFF.

